(text "INPUT SURGE CLAMP\nD19 SMBJ15CA at V_IN_FUSED clamps transients before Q1/Q2 (Vc 24.4 V < 30 V).\nFault domain: no damage up to 16.7 V sustained. Above that D19 conducts and is sacrificial;\nF1 (F4A) clears only if the source can supply several x 4 A. Q2/OVP still protects the board behind it.\nOVP (RV1) set ~16.0 V, below D1/D19 Vbr min 16.7 V." (at 88.9 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2408d9c2-3358-418e-bdde-b8ee3ee6b149"))
