(text "LOAD SWITCH SLEW CONTROL\nTurn-on: Q5 pulls gate via R25 220k; C19/R62 Miller -> V_LOAD ramps ~3 ms (15 V).\nSim: load cap up to ~220 uF + 1 A turns on without HW_OCP trip; 470 uF trips.\nTurn-off: Q6 -> D21 -> R47 47R, ~5.4 us at 15 V (sim). D14 = Q6 B-E clamp; D21 blocks fast turn-on path." (at 457.2 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0c2f9087-f774-49b8-8c0b-63f75e6df41d"))

